# Thai Typography

- Font stack: `Inter, "Noto Sans Thai", sans-serif`
- Minimum font weight: 400 (never 300 for Thai body text)
- Use `leading-relaxed` or `leading-loose` for Thai paragraphs
- Never apply `uppercase` or `tracking-*` to Thai text
- Technical terms: Thai label first, English in parentheses on first use (e.g. ความเหนื่อย (RPE))
